From: The VIctory-NVIDIA and PortVI contributors
Subject: Order unpredicated straight-line Wave64 LDS reads and writes on Wave32 hardware
Upstream: https://github.com/trustno1-coder/VIctory-NVIDIA/blob/2dc3df1c72275a1086330ad3b7cba7f9494fe874/crates/victory-shader/src/emit/lower.rs

Adapt the split-wave group barrier to a single console wave following one
unguarded block. Groups with multiple console waves and predicated accesses
retain the previous refusal. An unused LDS allocation requires no barrier.

